 *quit*
 	Quit foot. Default: _none_.
 
+*new-tab*
+	Open a new tab in the current tab's working directory. Default: _Control+Shift+t_.
+
+*next-tab*, *prev-tab*
+	Select the next/previous tab. Default: _Control+Next
+	Control+Shift+j_, _Control+Prior Control+Shift+k_.
+
+*move-tab-down*, *move-tab-up*
+	Move the current tab down/up in the sidebar. Default:
+	_Control+Shift+Next_, _Control+Shift+Prior_.
+
+*select-tab-1* ... *select-tab-9*
+	Select tab N. Default: _none_.
+
+*close-tab*
+	Close the current tab. Default: _none_.
+
+*merge-window*
+	Move all tabs of this window into the most recently focused other
+	foot window. Default: _none_.
+
+*detach-tab*
+	Move the current tab (or split view) into a new window. Default:
+	_none_.
+
+*toggle-sidebar*
+	Show or hide the sidebar. Default: _none_.
+
+*quick-switcher*
+	Search all tabs in all windows by title and jump to one. Default:
+	_Control+Shift+space_.
+
+*reopen-tab*
+	Reopen the most recently closed tab. Default: _Control+Shift+y_.
+
+*rename-tab*, *pin-tab*
+	Rename / pin or unpin the current tab. Default: _none_.
+
+*broadcast-input*
+	Toggle typing into all panes of the current split. Default:
+	_none_.
+
+*split-new*
+	Open a new tab side by side with the current one. Default: _none_.
+
+*split-next*
+	Join the next tab into the current split view. Default: _none_.
+
+*unsplit*
+	Break the current split view into separate tabs. Default: _none_.
+
+*focus-pane-next*, *focus-pane-prev*
+	Focus the next/previous pane of a split view. Default: _none_.
+
